<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">AWCP: A Workspace Delegation Protocol for Deep-Engagement Collaboration across Remote Agents</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">
