<td id="S4.T2.2.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t"><span id="S4.T2.2.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Branch-based VCS</span></td></tr>
