<td id="S4.T2.2.4.5" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="S4.T2.2.4.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Yes</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
